# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Step 1: Map problem to a quantum circuit {#step-1-map-problem-to-a-quantum-"
"circuit}"
msgstr ""
"Langkah 1: Petakan masalah ke Circuit kuantum {#step-1-map-problem-to-a-"
"quantum-circuit}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"First, we generate the SIAM Hamiltonian in the position basis. The "
"Hamiltonian is represented by the matrix $h_{pq}$ and the tensor $h_{pqrs}$."
" Then, we rotate it to the momentum basis. In the position basis, we place "
"the impurity at the first site. However, when we rotate to the momentum "
"basis, we move the impurity to a central site to facilitate interactions "
"with other orbitals.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pertama, kita membuat Hamiltonian SIAM dalam basis posisi. Hamiltonian "
"direpresentasikan oleh matriks $h_{pq}$ dan tensor $h_{pqrs}$. Kemudian, "
"kita merotasinya ke basis momentum. Dalam basis posisi, kita menempatkan "
"impuritas di situs pertama. Namun, ketika kita merotasi ke basis momentum, "
"kita memindahkan impuritas ke situs tengah untuk memudahkan interaksi dengan"
" orbital lain.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Next, we generate the circuits to produce the Krylov basis states.\n"
"For each spin species, the initial state $\\ket{\\psi_0}$ is given by the superposition of all possible excitations of the three electrons closest to the Fermi level into the 4 closest empty modes starting from the state $|00\\cdots 0011 \\cdots 11\\rangle$, and realized by the application of seven [XXPlusYYGate](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.XXPlusYYGate)s.\n"
"The time-evolved states are produced by successive applications of a second-order Trotter step.\n"
msgstr ""
"Selanjutnya, kita membuat Circuit untuk menghasilkan state basis Krylov.\n"
"Untuk setiap spesies spin, state awal $\\ket{\\psi_0}$ diberikan oleh superposisi dari semua kemungkinan eksitasi tiga elektron terdekat ke level Fermi ke dalam 4 mode kosong terdekat mulai dari state $|00\\cdots 0011 \\cdots 11\\rangle$, dan diwujudkan melalui aplikasi tujuh [XXPlusYYGate](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.XXPlusYYGate).\n"
"State yang berevolusi terhadap waktu dihasilkan oleh aplikasi berturut-turut dari langkah Trotter orde kedua.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"For a more detailed description of this model and how the circuits are "
"designed, refer to [\"Quantum-Centric Algorithm for Sample-Based Krylov "
"Diagonalization\"](https://arxiv.org/abs/2501.09702).\n"
msgstr ""
"Untuk deskripsi lebih rinci tentang model ini dan bagaimana Circuit "
"dirancang, lihat [\"Quantum-Centric Algorithm for Sample-Based Krylov "
"Diagonalization\"](https://arxiv.org/abs/2501.09702).\n"

